no Usagi-san", "english": "The Hare in Inaba"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "Usagi-san was washed away by some large waves. He cheats a crocodiles to get home. When he does, he was so dirty that his friends abandoned him because he was unrecognizable.", "startDate": {"year": 1935, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 1935, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 9, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Adventure"], "tags": []}, {"id": 112792, "title": {"romaji": "Nonsense Monogatari Dai Ippen: Sarugashima", "english": null}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "One of the first films of Kenzou Masaoka about a baby raised by monkeys on an island.", "startDate": {"year": 1931, "month": 2}, "endDate": {"year": 1931, "month": 2}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 24, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Adventure"], "tags": [{"name": "Ships", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Animals", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Adoption", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 112823, "title": {"romaji": "Manga no Rekkoku Rikugun", "english": null}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "Maru-san and Kaku-san have grown complacent in the long peace. They go to view a military parade, but it turns into a comparison of the military strength of countries around the world. In the end, they listen in on an arms control conference to find out what each country is really thinking.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Japanese Animated Film Classics)", "startDate": {"year": 1932, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 1932, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 28, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": [{"name": "War", "rank": 100, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Educational", "rank": 73, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Military", "rank": 73, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Tanks", "rank": 40, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Idol", "rank": 30, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Drawing", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "No Dialogue", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 112921, "title": {"romaji": "Hyaku-nengo no Aru Hi", "english": "A Day after a Hundred Years"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "Mr. Ogino should have died during the war but his spirit was brought back to life by the power of science. He sees the world 100 years later during the year 2032 lead by one of his descendants. They decide to take a trip to Mars too and the ship malfunctions, because a spirit of the past was on the ship, it went out of control trying to reach Buddha's paradise instead.\nShigeji Ogino is the director if this film, he used himself as the protagonist and even included real life footage of himself as well.", "startDate": {"year": 1933, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 1933, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 11, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Sci-Fi", "Supernatural"], "tags": [{"name": "Reincarnation", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Achromatic", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Aviation", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Military", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "No Dialogue", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Time Manipulation", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 112958, "title": {"romaji": "FELIX no Meitantei", "english": "Detective Felix in Trouble"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "Detective Felix the black cat springs into action to search for Hanako's stolen shoes.", "startDate": {"year": 1932, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 1932, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 10, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Mystery"], "tags": [{"name": "Achromatic", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Detective", "rank": 7